[00:22.56]1. Jehovah is faithful and fully aware
[00:28.03]Of all those who serve him whole-souled.
[00:33.21]He knows there are times their devotion and zeal
[00:39.21]Result in their loss as foretold.
[00:45.21]If you have left houses or fam’ly or friends,
[00:51.21]Be sure that our God knows the sum.
[00:58.56]He makes it up now with our dear brotherhood
[01:05.24]And life in the new world to come.
[01:07.82](Chorus)
[01:10.40]May Jehovah reward what you have done.
[01:17.36]May he provide a perfect wage for you.
[01:23.61]May you find refuge beneath his wings.
[01:35.32]Jehovah is faithful; Jehovah is true.
[02:10.17]2. At times we may feel that our lot in this life
[02:16.37]Has burdened us more than our share.
[02:23.23]And sometimes it seems that the cares of the day
[02:28.48]Are more than we’re able to bear.
[02:33.72]The God of all comfort takes note of your need;
[02:38.97]You know he’s the Hearer of prayer.
[02:48.28]His Word and his spirit and true, loving friends
[02:54.78]Will bring to you comfort and care.
[02:57.28](Chorus)
[02:59.78]May Jehovah reward what you have done.
[03:06.78]May he provide a perfect wage for you.
[03:13.92]May you find refuge beneath his wings.
[03:26.01]Jehovah is faithful; Jehovah is true.